      "accessed_on": "2026-10-05",
      "authority_reason": "Lightning-AI官方維護torchmetrics之原功能實作。",
      "inspection_note": "全文親讀：_cer_update lines23–49把字符串拆為characters并累计edit errors與len(target)；_cer_compute lines52–63 errors/total；char_error_rate lines66–87用途与零錯分數。未聲稱裝了TorchMetrics或執行官方此模組。"
    },
